container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/c77ef2fb/img_009_7d286faf.png\" alt=\"V sub B, times, open parenthesis, 1 minus H, close parenthesis, equals V sub P\"></span>. Dividing both sides by <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/c77ef2fb/img_010_afe313f2.png\" alt=\"V sub B \"></span> yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/c77ef2fb/img_011_d4cd54d2.png\" alt=\"1 minus H equals, the fraction V sub P, over V sub B\"></span>. Subtracting 1 from both sides yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/c77ef2fb/img_012_7d798b15.png\" alt=\"negative H equals, negative 1 plus, the fraction V sub P over V sub B\"></span>. Dividing both sides by <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/c77ef2fb/img_013_d3b569af.png\" alt=\"negative 1\"></span> yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/c77ef2fb/img_014_e559562d.png\" alt=\"H equals, 1 minus, the fraction V sub P over V sub B\"></span>.<p>Choices B, C, and D are incorrect and may result from errors made when manipulating the equation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n","answer_style":"Multiple Choice","section":"Math","image_count":15,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1691007959614,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"c77ef2fb","skill_cd":"P.B.","score_band_range_cd":5,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear equati