"currentColor\" x=\"-8\" dy=\"0.32em\" style=\"font-family: Noto Serif; font-size: 15px;\">8</text></g><g class=\"tick y-tick\" opacity=\"1\" transform=\"translate(0,14.513671875)\"><line stroke=\"currentColor\" x2=\"6px\" x1=\"-6px\" stroke-width=\"1px\"></line><rect x=\"-25.7\" y=\"-7.5\" width=\"18.7\" height=\"15\" style=\"fill: white;\"></rect><text fill=\"currentColor\" x=\"-8\" dy=\"0.32em\" style=\"font-family: Noto Serif; font-size: 15px;\">10</text></g><line class=\"y-axis-line\" y1=\"336.328125\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5px\"></line><line class=\"y-axis-line\" y1=\"336.328125\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5px\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"></line><text class=\"y-axis-label\" style=\"text-anchor: middle; dominant-baseline: text-after-edge; font-family: Noto Serif; font-style: italic; fill: currentColor; font-size: 15px;\" transform=\"translate(0,-12)\">y</text></g><text x=\"168.1640625\" y=\"168.1640625\" dx=\"-13.25px\" dy=\"13.5px\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; font-family: Noto Serif;\">O</text><path d=\"M95.954,336.315L97.441,305.96L98.954,277.497L100.495,250.93L102.062,226.257L103.656,203.471L105.284,182.474L106.946,163.27L108.641,145.855L110.369,130.213L111.251,123.018L112.145,116.226L113.047,109.885L113.961,103.946L114.89,98.412L115.831,93.284L116.787,88.561L117.755,84.245L118.737,80.332L119.733,76.822L120.749,73.69L121.778,70.957L122.827,68.605L123.897,66.634L124.623,65.529L125.363,64.589L126.116,63.816L126.876,63.217L127.65,62.786L128.04,62.634L128.437,62.524L128.834,62.456L129.231,62.431L129.634,62.447L130.045,62.506L130.455,62.606L130.865,62.747L131.706,63.158L132.56,63.735L133.435,64.483L134.329,65.403L135.244,66.495L136.179,67.759L137.141,69.202L138.715,71.848L140.377,74.979L142.139,78.62L144.036,82.84L145.832,87.062L147.85,92L156.285,113.422L160.18,122.984L162.305,127.955L164.33,132.484L166.287,136.645L168.198,140.483L170.424,144.655L172.617,148.433L174.79,151.84L176.956,154.897L178.039,156.298L179.122,157.613L180.211,158.851L181.301,160.004L182.397,161.079L183.494,162.069L184.597,162.982L185.714,163.822L187.375,164.919L189.063,165.855L189.918,166.261L190.779,166.627L191.646,166.953L192.528,167.24L193.416,167.487L194.31,167.695L195.218,167.864L196.147,167.997L197.088,168.09L198.043,168.146L199.019,168.164L200.014,168.144L201.609,168.039L203.277,167.841L205.032,167.549L206.916,167.157L208.557,166.762L210.393,166.277L216.73,164.462L219.225,163.781L221.748,163.166L224.055,162.691L226.504,162.302L227.687,162.163L228.851,162.059L230.001,161.99L231.145,161.955L232.282,161.955L233.418,161.99L235.362,162.13L237.32,162.374L239.318,162.723L241.383,163.183L243.219,163.665L245.21,164.253L251.405,166.28L253.484,166.922L255.549,167.476L257.378,167.859L258.455,168.02L259.477,168.121L260.459,168.163L261.408,168.145L262.322,168.068L263.21,167.93L264.071,167.733L264.912,167.473L265.699,167.166L266.473,166.799L267.233,166.371L267.973,165.887L268.699,165.341L269.412,164.735L270.112,164.068L270.798,163.34L272.143,161.689L273.448,159.781L274.713,157.615L275.95,155.17L277.161,152.439L278.338,149.441L279.495,146.139L280.625,142.552L281.735,138.658L282.818,134.482L283.888,129.972L284.937,125.154L285.98,119.959L287.002,114.451L288.011,108.591L289,102.422L289.982,95.857L290.944,88.983L292.827,74.183L294.664,57.922L296.46,40.13L298.209,20.873L299.924,0.003\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2px\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></path></g></svg><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for graph of a curve\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul>\n<li>Moving from left to right, the curve passes from quadrant 3 to quadrant 2 to quadrant 1.</li>\n<li>The curve has 2 relative maximums and 2 relative minimums.</li>\n<li>The curve crosses the x axis at the point (negative 2 comma 0).</li>\n<li>The curve touches the x axis at the following points:<br/>\n<ul>\n<li>(1 comma 0)</li>\n<li>(3 comma 0)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The graph of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"y equals g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is shown. If <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x plus 28 right parenthesis equals one tenth left parenthesis x minus a right parenthesis squared left parenthesis x minus b right parenthesis squared left parenthesis x minus c right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi>\n</math> are constants, which of the following could be the value of <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math>?</p>","keys":["28776a48-c384-4619-b0fc-165bd15c33e8"],"answerOptions":[{"id":"ea98cf83-be13-44f7-a61b-31bd051ada32","content":"<p><math alttext=\"31\"><mn>31</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"b1184a04-aba5-44f1-85b8-85fa4820f436","content":"<p><math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"243d7df8-784a-4ea3-a19c-b523db9cdc99","content":"<p><math alttext=\"negative 2\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"28776a48-c384-4619-b0fc-165bd15c33e8","content":"<p><math alttext=\"negative 25\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>25</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. Substituting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> in the given equation yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis b plus 28 right parenthesis equals one tenth left parenthesis b minus a right parenthesis squared left parenthesis b minus b right parenthesis squared left parenthesis b minus c right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, which is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis b plus 28 right parenthesis equals one tenth left parenthesis b minus a right parenthesis squared left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis squared left parenthesis b minus c right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis b plus 28 right parenthesis equals 0\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. It follows that when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x equals b plus 28\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 0\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. There are three points where the graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> intersects the <em>x</em>-axis: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis negative 2 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 1 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"left parenthesis 3 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis negative 2 right parenthesis equals 0\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis 1 right parenthesis equals 0\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"g left parenthesis 3 right parenthesis equals 0\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. It follows that either <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b plus 28 equals negative 2\"><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b plus 28 equals 1\"><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b plus 28 equals 3\"><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>. Subtracting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"28\"><mn>28</mn></math> from each side of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b plus 28 equals negative 2\"><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math> yields&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b equals negative 30\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></math>. Subtracting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"28\"><mn>28</mn></math> from each side of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b plus 28 equals 1\"><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> yields&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b equals negative 27\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></math>. Subtracting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"28\"><mn>28</mn></math> from each side of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b plus 28 equals 3\"><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> yields&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b equals negative 25\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></math>. Thus, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math> must be either&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"negative 30\"><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"negative 27\"><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></math>, or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"negative 25\"><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></math>. Of these values, only&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"negative 25\"><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></math> is given as a choice.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This would be a possible value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math> if the graph shown was the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals g left parenthesis x plus 28 right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, not&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This would be the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi></math>, not the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math>, if the graph shown was the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals g left parenthesis x plus 28 right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, not&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>","externalid":"f4d42535-f2e1-455c-b197-383e00a2a878","correct_answer":["D"]},"createDate":1776362727993,"updateDate":1776362727993}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1776362727993, 1776362727993),
