mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis one fourth right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"StartFraction 11 Over 4 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>. Note that 11/4 or 2.75 are examples of ways to enter a correct answer.</p>","externalid":"59addf61-9f46-4c0d-9dce-ebce1fa135b7","answerOptions":[],"correct_answer":["11/4","2.75"]},"createDate":1743430554982,"updateDate":1743430554982}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1743430554982, 1743430554982),
