<p>Choice B is incorrect. This is the solution to the equation <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="8 x equals 32"><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math>, not the given equation.</p>
